{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to bark loud and fight hard!</strong><br>In <i>Tails Island</i>, you start off as a brave, adventurous pup battling wild waves of animal enemies across mysterious islands armed with your favorite pet toys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349020/extras/b30d6eb60c1016cab0707a31a13658ce.poster.avif?t=1771354181\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349020/extras/b30d6eb60c1016cab0707a31a13658ce.webm?t=1771354181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349020/extras/b30d6eb60c1016cab0707a31a13658ce.mp4?t=1771354181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore. Fight. Evolve.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time combat</strong>: Face off against relentless enemy waves on compact islands using skills that level up as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic upgrades</strong>: Pick temporary boosts like AoE attacks, speed bursts, shields, and a whole arsenal of pet toys!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance-based rewards</strong>: At the end of each run, your gameplay is ranked as Normal, Epic, or Legendary. The better you perform, the stronger the rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349020/extras/2e3146448f0cf039587b9843f0647052.poster.avif?t=1771354181\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349020/extras/2e3146448f0cf039587b9843f0647052.webm?t=1771354181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349020/extras/2e3146448f0cf039587b9843f0647052.mp4?t=1771354181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your island. Power up your hero.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tails Island</i> is your home base. Build and upgrade structures to unlock permanent bonuses: faster movement, longer attack range, health regen, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic choices</strong>: Every building affects your playstyle. Will you go full speed or max out your damage?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc36\ud83d\udc31\ud83d\udc22 Unlock heroes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable characters</strong>: Start with the dog, then unlock</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 A lightning-fast cat with deadly crits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc22 A tanky turtle with ironclad defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc15 Other dogs with unique combat styles</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique abilities</strong>: Each hero has their own stats and powers, giving you fresh ways to play and dominate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to defend your new home and become a legend?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349020?t=1771354181","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349020?t=1771354181","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349020/2931b181308f68df14a67740cfc75e4dd39e86ec/capsule_231x87.jpg